  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "Three weeks without saying a monologue out loud. How long has it been for you? Ghost Light has one speech waiting every night. The voice is AI. #monologue #audition #actorslife #actortok #theatrekid",
    "youtube_title": "Three weeks without saying a monologue out loud. #shorts",
    "youtube_description": "Three weeks without saying a monologue out loud.\nMilo is an actor, he acts, but a spider has moved into his audition folder and a plant is growing over it. So he opened Ghost Light, where tonight's speech was already waiting, and said Van from What Happened to the Dollar by Sam Graber out loud. Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #acting",
    "instagram": "Three weeks without saying a monologue out loud.\n\nSigns it has been too long:\n1. A spider lives in your audition folder.\n2. You said \"tomorrow\" yesterday.\n3. A plant is winning.\n\nGhost Light keeps one speech waiting for you every night. Tap Read it and say it out loud. Tonight Milo got Van from What Happened to the Dollar by Sam Graber.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#monologue #audition #actorslife #actorsofinstagram #actortraining"
